#: model:ir.model.fields,help:rma_lot.field_rma_operation__deliver_same_lot
msgid ""
"If enabled, the replacement or delivery product will use the exact "
"lot/serial number received from the customer. Disable if a different lot or "
"serial number should be assigned."
